From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: taynotfound <marztayron@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:20:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rain-0961: sweetfb_fit scales the iPhone X canvas to the panel

The Redmi 10C (rain) panel is 720x1650; the 1125x2436 iPhone X canvas was
shown as a cropped centre window. Boot-arg sweetfb_fit=1 scales the canvas
to the panel width (16/25 on rain: 720x1559, 45 px bars), bilinear, into
the flip buffers, in both the direct and the multi-layer present paths.
sweetfb_noshadow=1 now keeps the flip buffers (they allocate fine on rain)
and only skips the fade and console shadow buffers. Off by default: topaz
is unchanged.
---
diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetFramebuffer.cpp
